if it were stolen.

00:11:47.507 --> 00:11:51.470
Therefore, we'll need to hire on
additional security for the mission.

00:11:51.678 --> 00:11:54.473
Oh, oh, oh, oh! Mr. Professor? Right here!

00:11:54.598 --> 00:11:57.184
Uh, maybe we should stick with
people we know and trust.

00:11:57.267 --> 00:11:58.685
I mean, Flexo's great, but...

00:11:58.769 --> 00:12:00.103
Flexo's great, you say?

00:12:00.187 --> 00:12:02.105
Well, that's good enough for me.

00:12:02.189 --> 00:12:04.566
Welcome aboard, lad.

00:12:14.368 --> 00:12:16.954
Space banditos have been
operating in this quadrant,

00:12:17.037 --> 00:12:19.831
so you'll each take eight-hour shifts
guarding the safe.

00:12:19.915 --> 00:12:22.584
First Bender, then Flexo, then Fry.

00:12:22.668 --> 00:12:24.711
Wait, hold on.
I don't like the sound of that.

00:12:24.795 --> 00:12:26.171
Let's just go alphabetically.

00:12:26.255 --> 00:12:29.716
Okay. First Bender, then Flexo, then Fry.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.218
